			"notes": "Added port for 1.16.1 and 1.16.2\n1.16 will continue to receive updates alongside 1.15, 1.14, and 1.12.\n\nNote that this port is considered a beta because it has not been heavily tested.\nPlease report any issues.\n\nThere are separate 1.16.1 and 1.16.2 versions for now because several of the supported mods from the 1.15 version are updated to 1.16.1 but not to 1.16.2 yet.\nAs more of the supported mods update to 1.16.1 or 1.16.2, I'll re-enable their InvMove compatibility.\n\nBelow are the statuses of mods that had compatibility in the 1.15 version.\nMods that haven't updated to 1.16.1 (not supported in either 1.16 InvMove version):\n- [Music Maker Mod](www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/music-maker-mod)\n- [Charm](www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/charm)\n- [Create](www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create)\n- [Ender Storage 1.8.+](www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ender-storage-1-8)\n\nMods that haven't updated to 1.16.2 (supported in InvMove 1.16.1 but not 1.16.2):\n- [Immersive Engineering](www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-engineering)\n- [EmbellishCraft](www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/embellishcraft)\n- [MrCrayfish's Furniture Mod](www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mrcrayfish-furniture-mod)\n- [Quark](www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark)\n- [Botania](www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botania)\n- [Mekanism](www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism)\n- [Mekanism Additions](www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-additions)\n- [Mekanism Generators](www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-generators)\n- [Mekanism Tools](www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-tools)\n- [Industrial Foregoing](www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/industrial-foregoing)\n- [Waystones](www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/waystones)"
